        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 64036, Modern Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimplistic in design, Omnia's 64036 Narrow Backset Lockset has a modern minimalist appeal. Made out of solid brass, this contemporary handleset is available in brass, polished chrome, and satin chrome finishes. It is offered in several different functions including single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry. It is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2\" or 2\". \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available Matching <a href=\"/products/modern-chic-leverset-with-square-rose-omnia-36s-00\"><b>Modern Chic Leverset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Narrow Backset Handleset With Chic Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" keyway (for key functions).</li>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid brass with a heavy gauge plated steel case.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass 1/2\" lachbolt and 1\" deadbolt</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 1-1/2\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x lip 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1/2\" x 3/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" x 1\" x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Case:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-1/2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-13/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN_narrow_bs_mortise_dimentions.pdf?v=1704262277\" target=\"new\"><b>Narrow Backset Mortise Lock Specification Diagram</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Narrow Backset Lockset, Omnia 64036",
                "description": "Omnia 64036 Contemporary Narrow Backset Lockset - Simplistic in design, Omnia's 64036 Narrow Backset Lockset has a modern minimalist appeal. Made out of solid brass, this contemporary handleset is available in brass, polished chrome, and satin chrome finishes. It is offered in several different functions including single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry. It is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2 inches or 2 inches.",
                "keywords": "small backset locksets, omnia narrow backset mortise locks, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, OMN-64036, Omnia 64036, modern Narrow Backset Handlesets, contemporary Narrow Backset Mortise Locksets, narrow backset handlesets, contemporary handlesets, modern handlesets, contemporary entrance sets, contemporary mortise entrancesets, contemporary front door handles,"
